    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Your privacy matters to us.\n\nInstafact uses your phone number, profile details, shared video links, fact-check activity, and notification token only to run the app, deliver results, personalize your experience, and improve reliability.\n\nWe do not sell your personal data. We do not share your personal data with advertisers. Your submitted content and account details are not posted publicly unless you explicitly choose to share something yourself.\n\nYour data is only accessed within Instafact systems and trusted service providers that help us operate the product, such as secure hosting, storage, and notifications. These providers are used only to support the service.\n\nWe take reasonable steps to protect your data and limit access to what is needed to provide fact-checking, notifications, support, and account management.\n\nIf you have any privacy concerns or want help with your account, you can contact us anytime at connect@instafact.co.</string>
